/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 370 0 R
/T (Start your day early morning, Have breakfast. Trek towardsPhugtal monastery \(a 2550-year-old monastery carved into a mountain.\) & only monastery where you can reach by foot. Approx 1 -hour trek. Enjoy some free time at Phugtal monastery. Learn more about the History of Zanskar Region. Reach back to Purne by afternoon & drive towards Rangdum. Check into homestay and take some rest & fresh up. Dinner & overnight stay at Padum.)
/E (Start your day early morning, Have breakfast. Trek towardsPhugtal monastery \(a 2550-year-old monastery carved into a mountain.\) & only monastery where you can reach by foot. Approx 1 -hour trek. Enjoy some free time at Phugtal monastery. Learn more about the History of Zanskar Region. Reach back to Purne by afternoon & drive towards Rangdum. Check into homestay and take some rest & fresh up. Dinner & overnight stay at Padum.)
/Pg 19 0 R
